        "text_U6BBKW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Crafted from high-quality materials, the Ameda Universal Breast Pump Travel Bag is designed for durability and practicality. With smart storage compartments and an insulated section to keep milk cool, this compact and portable solution is perfect for busy moms who value convenience and organization. Its spacious interior provides ample room for pump parts, milk storage, and other essentials, making it a reliable companion whether you're at home, at work, or on the go. When not in use for pumping, it’s versatile enough to double as a storage bag for snacks, baby essentials, or other daily necessities. </p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
